  <!-- EN:
    <li>questDescription->Recently, you have noticed abnormal activities of hostile forces nearby. They seem to be dispatching troops to an unknown ancient building. Your informant told you that it is an ancient grain farm, and the appearance of such enemy strongholds near your base makes you feel uneasy. Perhaps it is time to eliminate them.</li>
