  <Informant_Occupied_devilstrand_cotton_farm.root.nodes.siteDestroyed.node.nodes.Letter.label.slateRef>Misión fallida: [resolvedQuestName]</Informant_Occupied_devilstrand_cotton_farm.root.nodes.siteDestroyed.node.nodes.Letter.label.slateRef>
  <!-- EN: You failed to complete the occupied devilstrand cotton farm mission,[siteFaction_name] blew up the monorail system and destroyed known roads. -->
  <Informant_Occupied_devilstrand_cotton_farm.root.nodes.siteDestroyed.node.nodes.Letter.text.slateRef>Fallaste en completar la misión de la granja de hilodiablo ocupada, [siteFaction_name] voló el sistema de monorraíl y destruyó los caminos conocidos.</Informant_Occupied_devilstrand_cotton_farm.root.nodes.siteDestroyed.node.nodes.Letter.text.slateRef>
  <!-- EN: Payment arrived -->
  <Informant_Occupied_devilstrand_cotton_farm.root.nodes.siteAllEnemiesDefeated.node.nodes.GiveRewards.customLetterLabel.slateRef>Pago recibido</Informant_Occupied_devilstrand_cotton_farm.root.nodes.siteAllEnemiesDefeated.node.nodes.GiveRewards.customLetterLabel.slateRef>
